常见问题与排查（按优先顺序）
- Socket.IO 连接失败:
  - 检查 backend logs: server started and socket.io bound.
  - Ensure frontend socket origin is correctly computed (frontend/src/libs/socket.ts). If frontend served on different host/port, update backend CORS or socket origin.
- job_updates not arriving at frontend:
  - Check processor publishes to Redis: processor logs show publishJobUpdate executed.
  - Check backend subscribed to Redis job_updates: backend logs "Subscribed to job_updates".
  - Ensure Redis host/port env vars are correct in docker-compose for backend & processor.
- Mask upload fails (413 / payload too large):
  - Increase express.json limit in backend index.ts (we set 20mb). For large masks use multipart upload (MaskEditor already uses JSON dataUrl; we also support multipart).
- DB migration not run:
  - Run backend migration script manually (steps above). Ensure PG env vars are correct.

