# Measurement Service (Detectron2 PoC)

This is a minimal FastAPI service that runs a segmentation/measurement inference over uploaded vehicle images.
It attempts to use Detectron2 if available; otherwise it falls back to a simple OpenCV contour-based segmentation.

Endpoints:
